        <div class="as-title-bottom">
          <span>contra</span>
          <strong>CAÍDAS</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="as-subtitle">¡Proteje tu vida y eleva tu seguridad a nuevos niveles!</div>
      </div>
      <div class="as-logo">
        <img src="https://banamailing.com/andes-safety/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Guardian-Master-Logo-Colour1-1-jpg.webp" alt="">
